1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,950
Huh? My snow bunny was right here!

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,579
Where did she go?

3
00:00:04,579 --> 00:00:05,200
Guess!

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,565
I see her yellow mittens in a puddle!

5
00:00:11,115 --> 00:00:13,481
Let's find out what happened.

6
00:00:13,731 --> 00:00:14,788
Come on!

7
00:00:16,638 --> 00:00:17,691
This morning,

8
00:00:17,691 --> 00:00:18,809
we made Sunny,

9
00:00:18,809 --> 00:00:19,927
my snow bunny.

10
00:00:20,477 --> 00:00:23,265
Can you see her long ears?

11
00:00:23,515 --> 00:00:25,631
Point to them!

12
00:00:27,631 --> 00:00:29,378
Then the sun came out.

13
00:00:29,378 --> 00:00:31,265
Is the sun warm or cold?

14
00:00:33,265 --> 00:00:36,535
Warm! Lovely, warm sunshine.

15
00:00:38,385 --> 00:00:41,481
Drip! Something wet landed on my nose!

16
00:00:42,031 --> 00:00:44,723
What is on Pip's nose?

17
00:00:46,723 --> 00:00:49,915
A water drop from the icicles!

18
00:00:50,165 --> 00:00:51,973
Hee hee!

19
00:00:52,523 --> 00:00:53,565
It tickles!

20
00:00:53,565 --> 00:00:54,234
Achoo!

21
00:00:56,134 --> 00:00:57,728
Look up at the roof.

22
00:00:57,728 --> 00:00:59,737
The icicles go drip, drop!

23
00:01:00,287 --> 00:01:02,067
Let's count the drops.

24
00:01:02,067 --> 00:01:02,708
Ready?

25
00:01:03,108 --> 00:01:05,785
How many drops can you count?

26
00:01:07,585 --> 00:01:10,813
One, two, three, four, five drops!

27
00:01:11,363 --> 00:01:14,286
Wiggle your fingers down, like drips.

28
00:01:14,536 --> 00:01:16,210
Drip, drip, drop!

29
00:01:19,110 --> 00:01:21,706
Oh! Sunny's ears flopped down.

30
00:01:21,956 --> 00:01:23,436
She looks sleepy!

31
00:01:23,986 --> 00:01:26,467
What is happening to Sunny?

32
00:01:28,467 --> 00:01:30,947
I think she's melting!

33
00:01:32,797 --> 00:01:34,134
That's right.

34
00:01:34,134 --> 00:01:36,389
The warm sun melts snow.

35
00:01:36,639 --> 00:01:39,042
Snow turns into water.

36
00:01:39,592 --> 00:01:42,054
Can we see it happen up close?

37
00:01:42,604 --> 00:01:46,608
Yes! Let's do a little experiment in the kitchen.

38
00:01:48,458 --> 00:01:50,958
Here is a cup full of snow.

39
00:01:51,208 --> 00:01:53,975
Our kitchen is nice and warm.

40
00:01:54,525 --> 00:01:56,853
Will the snow stay snow?

41
00:01:56,853 --> 00:01:57,802
Or melt?

42
00:01:58,052 --> 00:01:59,897
What do you think?

43
00:02:01,897 --> 00:02:03,280
Let's wait and see.

44
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,916
Tick, tock, tick, tock.

45
00:02:08,316 --> 00:02:10,989
Wow! Is it snow or water now?

46
00:02:12,989 --> 00:02:16,200
Water! The snow melted in the warm kitchen!

47
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:18,813
Warm makes snow melt.

48
00:02:18,813 --> 00:02:20,877
Cold keeps it frozen.

49
00:02:22,727 --> 00:02:25,275
Let's play Warm or Cold!

50
00:02:25,825 --> 00:02:27,598
A cup of cocoa.

51
00:02:27,598 --> 00:02:29,175
Warm or cold?

52
00:02:31,175 --> 00:02:33,598
Warm! Blow on it first, whoo!

53
00:02:34,148 --> 00:02:35,586
A snowball.

54
00:02:35,586 --> 00:02:37,230
Warm or cold?

55
00:02:39,230 --> 00:02:40,480
Cold! Brrr!

56
00:02:42,330 --> 00:02:43,831
Pip! Come quick!

57
00:02:43,831 --> 00:02:46,042
Sunny is getting smaller!

58
00:02:46,592 --> 00:02:47,785
Drip, drip, drip.

59
00:02:47,785 --> 00:02:49,515
Where are the drips going?

60
00:02:51,515 --> 00:02:52,985
Into the ground!

61
00:02:52,985 --> 00:02:54,611
Let's follow them.

62
00:02:56,461 --> 00:02:57,183
Shh! Look!

63
00:02:57,183 --> 00:02:58,516
Little white flowers,

64
00:02:58,516 --> 00:02:59,961
poking out of the snow.

65
00:03:00,511 --> 00:03:03,492
They look sleepy, and thirsty.

66
00:03:04,042 --> 00:03:06,272
Are their heads up or down?

67
00:03:08,272 --> 00:03:10,945
Down. They need a drink.

68
00:03:14,195 --> 00:03:16,503
Look! The flowers woke up!

69
00:03:16,753 --> 00:03:18,503
Their heads went up!

70
00:03:19,053 --> 00:03:20,734
They are snowdrops.

71
00:03:20,734 --> 00:03:24,247
The melted snow gave them a drink of water.

72
00:03:24,797 --> 00:03:27,586
Sunny is helping the flowers grow!

73
00:03:28,136 --> 00:03:30,539
Can you grow like a flower?

74
00:03:30,789 --> 00:03:32,143
Curl up small,

75
00:03:32,143 --> 00:03:33,895
then reach up tall!

76
00:03:37,195 --> 00:03:39,361
And now there's a puddle!

77
00:03:39,361 --> 00:03:40,599
Can I splash?

78
00:03:41,149 --> 00:03:42,477
A little splash,

79
00:03:42,477 --> 00:03:44,015
with Mama watching!

80
00:03:45,865 --> 00:03:47,847
Splash! Quack, quack!

81
00:03:47,847 --> 00:03:49,499
Ducks love water!

82
00:03:50,049 --> 00:03:53,107
Can you jump and splash with me?

83
00:03:53,357 --> 00:03:55,818
One, two, splash!

84
00:03:58,918 --> 00:04:01,380
Now I know where Sunny went!

85
00:04:01,930 --> 00:04:03,396
She turned into water,

86
00:04:03,396 --> 00:04:04,510
for the flowers,

87
00:04:04,510 --> 00:04:05,507
and for Dotty!

88
00:04:06,057 --> 00:04:08,213
And when it gets cold again,

89
00:04:08,213 --> 00:04:09,883
the water can freeze,

90
00:04:09,883 --> 00:04:11,691
and more snow can fall.

91
00:04:12,241 --> 00:04:14,107
Then we'll build Sunny again,

92
00:04:14,107 --> 00:04:15,972
with the same yellow mittens!

93
00:04:17,822 --> 00:04:19,971
Sing the Drip Drop Song with me,

94
00:04:19,971 --> 00:04:21,322
and do the actions!

95
00:04:21,922 --> 00:04:23,007
Drip, drop,

96
00:04:23,007 --> 00:04:24,480
the sun is warm.

97
00:04:24,730 --> 00:04:26,960
Wiggle your fingers down!

98
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:30,591
Snow turns to water, drip, drip, drop!

99
00:04:30,991 --> 00:04:32,307
Into the ground,

100
00:04:32,307 --> 00:04:33,760
the flowers drink.

101
00:04:34,010 --> 00:04:35,972
Reach up tall and grow!

102
00:04:36,372 --> 00:04:39,180
Splash in the puddle, one, two, three!

103
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,534
One more time!

104
00:04:42,534 --> 00:04:44,010
Wiggle and reach!

105
00:04:44,410 --> 00:04:47,641
Snow turns to water, drip, drip, drop!

106
00:04:48,041 --> 00:04:49,356
Into the ground,

107
00:04:49,356 --> 00:04:50,810
the flowers drink.

108
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:53,022
Reach up tall and grow!

109
00:04:53,422 --> 00:04:56,229
Splash in the puddle, one, two, three!

110
00:04:57,029 --> 00:05:00,897
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

111
00:05:01,497 --> 00:05:02,399
Next time,

112
00:05:02,399 --> 00:05:06,214
Pip Puppy and Lulu Lamb take turns on a snowy slide.

113
00:05:06,464 --> 00:05:07,903
Whee!

114
00:05:08,503 --> 00:05:09,720
Bye bye, friends!

115
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:12,214
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!

116
00:05:14,614 --> 00:05:17,576
Brrr, the sun is going down.

117
00:05:17,826 --> 00:05:21,345
Lulu, what are you thankful for today?

118
00:05:21,895 --> 00:05:22,889
My friends!

119
00:05:22,889 --> 00:05:24,948
What are YOU thankful for?

120
00:05:25,198 --> 00:05:26,592
Tell me!

121
00:05:28,792 --> 00:05:32,426
Lovely! Are you ready for the last story?

122
00:05:32,676 --> 00:05:34,657
Say, yes!

123
00:05:36,657 --> 00:05:40,141
Yay! It's Lulu Lamb's Thank-You Goodnight.

124
00:05:40,391 --> 00:05:41,948
Let's watch!

125
00:05:43,198 --> 00:05:45,862
Look, a little paper heart!

126
00:05:46,112 --> 00:05:48,612
It's a thank-you heart.

127
00:05:49,162 --> 00:05:51,498
What are you thankful for?

128
00:05:53,498 --> 00:05:57,317
Thankful means you feel happy for something you have.

129
00:05:59,167 --> 00:06:00,953
Here's our Thank-You Jar.

130
00:06:00,953 --> 00:06:01,846
Before bed,

131
00:06:01,846 --> 00:06:04,143
we put in three thank-you hearts.

132
00:06:04,693 --> 00:06:07,746
But I didn't get a present today.

133
00:06:07,996 --> 00:06:10,783
What can I say thank you for?

134
00:06:12,683 --> 00:06:15,654
I'll take a heart from the basket.

135
00:06:15,904 --> 00:06:17,420
Got one!

136
00:06:17,970 --> 00:06:20,313
Wait! Is that a heart?

137
00:06:22,313 --> 00:06:24,990
It's a sock with hearts on it!

138
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,694
Pip's red sock!

139
00:06:26,694 --> 00:06:27,583
Hee hee!

140
00:06:28,133 --> 00:06:29,096
Silly me!

141
00:06:29,096 --> 00:06:31,022
That heart is a sock!

142
00:06:32,922 --> 00:06:36,815
This morning I played in the snow with my friends!

143
00:06:37,365 --> 00:06:40,460
Who is that puppy in the red hat?

144
00:06:40,710 --> 00:06:42,697
Say his name!

145
00:06:44,697 --> 00:06:46,305
It's me, Pip Puppy!

146
00:06:46,305 --> 00:06:47,255
Woof woof!

147
00:06:49,105 --> 00:06:51,953
How many friends played with me?

148
00:06:52,203 --> 00:06:54,170
Count with me!

149
00:06:55,970 --> 00:06:56,896
Pip, one.

150
00:06:56,896 --> 00:06:57,975
Dotty, two.

151
00:06:57,975 --> 00:06:59,208
Honey, three!

152
00:06:59,758 --> 00:07:02,463
Can you wave to your friends?

153
00:07:02,713 --> 00:07:04,516
Wave, wave!

154
00:07:07,416 --> 00:07:08,976
My first thank-you!

155
00:07:08,976 --> 00:07:10,961
Thank you for my friends.

156
00:07:11,511 --> 00:07:13,992
What colour is this heart?

157
00:07:15,992 --> 00:07:17,792
Pink! In it goes.

158
00:07:17,792 --> 00:07:18,512
Plop!

159
00:07:21,412 --> 00:07:22,757
And at lunch,

160
00:07:22,757 --> 00:07:24,691
Mama made warm soup.

161
00:07:24,941 --> 00:07:25,883
Mmm!

162
00:07:26,433 --> 00:07:28,691
What colour is the soup?

163
00:07:30,691 --> 00:07:32,276
Orange carrot soup!

164
00:07:32,276 --> 00:07:33,718
Blow on it first,

165
00:07:33,718 --> 00:07:35,375
so it's not too hot.

166
00:07:35,625 --> 00:07:37,106
Whoo!

167
00:07:37,706 --> 00:07:40,472
Yum! Can you pat your tummy?

168
00:07:40,722 --> 00:07:42,730
Pat, pat, pat!

169
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:47,376
My second thank-you!

170
00:07:47,376 --> 00:07:49,728
Thank you for my yummy food.

171
00:07:50,278 --> 00:07:52,759
What colour is this heart?

172
00:07:54,759 --> 00:07:57,464
Yellow, like the sunshine!

173
00:07:57,714 --> 00:07:58,759
Plop!

174
00:08:00,609 --> 00:08:01,756
Now one more.

175
00:08:01,756 --> 00:08:04,195
Hmm, what's my third thank-you?

176
00:08:04,795 --> 00:08:06,657
Look around you, Lulu.

177
00:08:06,657 --> 00:08:08,071
What do you see?

178
00:08:09,671 --> 00:08:11,205
A warm house.

179
00:08:11,205 --> 00:08:12,930
A soft blanket.

180
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:15,925
And a big snuggly hug!

181
00:08:17,775 --> 00:08:20,665
Thank you for my cosy home!

182
00:08:21,215 --> 00:08:23,695
What colour is this heart?

183
00:08:25,695 --> 00:08:27,457
Blue! Plop!

184
00:08:28,007 --> 00:08:30,629
Can you give yourself a big hug?

185
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:32,578
Squeeze!

186
00:08:36,778 --> 00:08:39,326
Let's count the hearts together.

187
00:08:39,726 --> 00:08:41,619
How many hearts?

188
00:08:43,419 --> 00:08:44,879
One, two, three!

189
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:46,801
Pink, yellow and blue!

190
00:08:48,651 --> 00:08:51,525
Wait! I have a surprise heart, too.

191
00:08:52,075 --> 00:08:53,304
A surprise?

192
00:08:53,304 --> 00:08:55,148
What colour is it?

193
00:08:57,148 --> 00:08:59,019
Purple! Thank you, Lulu,

194
00:08:59,019 --> 00:09:00,613
for being my friend!

195
00:09:01,163 --> 00:09:02,133
Oh, Honey!

196
00:09:02,133 --> 00:09:05,343
That makes my heart feel warm and glowy!

197
00:09:08,593 --> 00:09:10,596
Look! The jar is glowing,

198
00:09:10,596 --> 00:09:12,528
and here comes the Moon!

199
00:09:13,078 --> 00:09:15,161
When you say thank you,

200
00:09:15,161 --> 00:09:17,244
two friends feel happy.

201
00:09:17,494 --> 00:09:20,264
Your friend, and you!

202
00:09:20,814 --> 00:09:24,031
Who can you say thank you to tonight?

203
00:09:27,331 --> 00:09:28,505
Into bed now.

204
00:09:28,505 --> 00:09:30,559
Let's do heart breathing!

205
00:09:31,109 --> 00:09:33,691
Put your hand on your heart.

206
00:09:34,241 --> 00:09:35,891
Breathe in slowly,

207
00:09:35,891 --> 00:09:38,012
like smelling warm soup.

208
00:09:40,412 --> 00:09:42,097
Breathe out slowly,

209
00:09:42,097 --> 00:09:43,629
and blow it cool.

210
00:09:43,879 --> 00:09:45,006
Whoo.

211
00:09:47,406 --> 00:09:49,652
Now stretch your arms up high,

212
00:09:49,652 --> 00:09:52,170
and wrap them round in a cosy hug.

213
00:09:55,270 --> 00:09:56,581
Sing with me,

214
00:09:56,581 --> 00:09:58,385
and do the actions!

215
00:09:58,985 --> 00:10:01,017
Thank you for my friends,

216
00:10:01,017 --> 00:10:02,468
who play with me.

217
00:10:02,718 --> 00:10:04,521
Wave, wave!

218
00:10:04,921 --> 00:10:08,036
Thank you for my food, so yummy.

219
00:10:08,286 --> 00:10:10,253
Pat your tummy!

220
00:10:10,653 --> 00:10:12,517
Thank you for my home,

221
00:10:12,517 --> 00:10:14,157
so warm and bright.

222
00:10:14,407 --> 00:10:16,641
Hug yourself tight!

223
00:10:17,041 --> 00:10:20,094
Thank you, thank you, and goodnight!

224
00:10:20,344 --> 00:10:22,332
Blow a kiss!

225
00:10:24,432 --> 00:10:26,641
One more time, softly.

226
00:10:26,641 --> 00:10:27,260
Shh.

227
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:29,724
Thank you for my home,

228
00:10:29,724 --> 00:10:31,364
so warm and bright.

229
00:10:31,614 --> 00:10:33,847
Hug yourself tight!

230
00:10:34,247 --> 00:10:37,301
Thank you, thank you, and goodnight!

231
00:10:37,551 --> 00:10:39,538
Blow a kiss!

232
00:10:40,338 --> 00:10:42,347
Yawn. Thank you, Honey.

233
00:10:42,347 --> 00:10:43,351
Goodnight.

234
00:10:45,651 --> 00:10:48,546
Blow a kiss to someone you love,

235
00:10:48,546 --> 00:10:50,283
and say thank you.

236
00:10:50,533 --> 00:10:52,077
Goodnight!

237
00:10:53,677 --> 00:10:57,545
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

238
00:10:58,145 --> 00:10:59,092
Next time,

239
00:10:59,092 --> 00:11:01,423
Pip Puppy makes a snow bunny.

240
00:11:01,673 --> 00:11:02,902
But drip, drip,

241
00:11:02,902 --> 00:11:04,268
where will it go?

242
00:11:04,868 --> 00:11:06,789
Sweet dreams, friends!

243
00:11:06,789 --> 00:11:09,941
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!

244
00:11:12,541 --> 00:11:14,829
That's all for now, friends!

245
00:11:15,079 --> 00:11:17,257
Come back soon for more stories

246
00:11:17,257 --> 00:11:19,371
and songs on Honey Bunny Kidz.

247
00:11:19,621 --> 00:11:21,319
Bye bye!
